  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NIR Workplace Poilcy II - Workplace Policy</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NIR Workplace policy II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta projekt &#xE4;r en forts&#xE4;ttning och expansion av SWHAP 2004-2008. Det huvudsakliga m&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att bist&#xE5; arbetstagare och arbetsgivare p&#xE5; Sverige-relaterade f&#xF6;retag att skapa effektiva hiv och AIDS program som bidrar till utvecklandet av privata sektorns roll i kampen mot AIDS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a continuation and expansion of the SWHAP implemented during 2004-2008. The primary object of the project is to support employers and employees at Swedish related workplaces in the region, to create effective HIV and AIDS programmes that contribute to the development of a wider private sector response to the epidemic.</narrative>
  </description>
